                        <li><strong>Cars are
                                depreciating assets</strong> - They lose 15-20% value in first year, 50% in 3 years
                        </li>
                        <li><strong>Insurance renewal
                                costs</strong> - Budget ₹15K-20K annually after 1st year</li>
                        <li><strong>Maintenance costs
                                increase</strong> - After warranty (3-5 years), service costs rise significantly
                        </li>
                        <li><strong>Fuel + maintenance</strong> -
